msgid "Add Remedy Integration"
msgstr "Ajouter une intégration Remedy"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/remedy.rst:94
msgid "Navigate to |AdmInt|"
msgstr "Accédez à |AdmInt|"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/remedy.rst:95
msgid "Select ``+ NEW INTEGRATION``"
msgstr "Sélectionnez ``+ NEW INTEGRATION``"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/remedy.rst:96
msgid "Select ``Remedy`` from the dropdown."
msgstr "Sélectionnez ``Remedy`` dans la liste déroulante."

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/remedy.rst:97
msgid "Add the following:"
msgstr "Ajoutez les éléments suivants :"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/remedy.rst:99
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "NAME"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/remedy.rst:100
msgid "Name of the Integration in Morpheus."
msgstr "Nom de l'intégration dans Morpheus."

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/remedy.rst:101
msgid "ENABLE"
msgstr "ENABLE"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/remedy.rst:102
msgid "Leave checked to enable the Integration."
msgstr "Laissez coché pour activer l'intégration."

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/remedy.rst:103
msgid "REMEDY HOST"
msgstr "REMEDY HOST"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/remedy.rst:104
msgid "Url of the Remedy Instance. e.g: http://xx.xx.xx.xx:8008"
msgstr "URL de l'instance Remedy. Ex. : http://xx.xx.xx.xx:8008"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/remedy.rst:105
msgid "USER"
msgstr "USER"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/remedy.rst:106
msgid "Enter in username"
msgstr "Saisissez le nom d'utilisateur"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/remedy.rst:107
msgid "PASSWORD"
msgstr "PASSWORD"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/remedy.rst:108
msgid "Above Remedy user's password"
msgstr "Mot de passe de l'utilisateur Remedy ci-dessus"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/remedy.rst:109
msgid "COMPANY"
msgstr "COMPANY"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/remedy.rst:110
msgid ""
"The dropdown will populate with values as soon as the auth using the "
"above creds are successful"
msgstr "La liste déroulante sera alimentée dès que l'authentification avec les identifiants ci-dessus réussira"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/remedy.rst:111
msgid "APPROVAL USER"
msgstr "APPROVAL USER"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/remedy.rst:112
msgid ""
"Full name of the user as it appear in Remedy. E.g: userid 'anish' would "
"have full name as \"Anish Abraham\""
msgstr "Nom complet de l'utilisateur tel qu'il apparaît dans Remedy. Ex. : l'utilisateur « anish » aurait pour nom complet « Anish Abraham »"

